flowchart LR
  subgraph design [Design stage]
    OE[On-site Expert]
    RS[Research Synthesizer / Researchers]
    PL[Planner]
    OE <--> RS
    RS --> PL
    OE --> PL
  end
  subgraph build [Light build stage]
    IM[Implementer]
    EV[Evaluator]
    IM -->|review_ready| EV
    EV -->|feedback| IM
  end
  PL -->|refined-technical-handoff| IM
  PL -->|same handoff| EV
  IM -.->|named fork| OE
  EV -.->|named evidence conflict| OE
  P[Parent orchestrator] -.->|dispatch only| IM
  P -.->|dispatch only| EV
